Engaging takes no lock: set_active(1) writes s_pt.active and s_pt.activation while the present thread reads them under s_pt.mx. The race detector's negative control (present_sched_tsan); no property names it.

--- a/core/runtime/present_thread.c
+++ b/core/runtime/present_thread.c
@@ -979,17 +979,16 @@
